      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>As of commit <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/93a8e636ab22559a9100eedea20f83f8bb9077d6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">93a8e63</a><br/>\n I am seeing this:</p>\n\n\n<p>{{ &gt; curl -i -d \"&lt;&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://awoods.com/#title\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://awoods.com#title</a>&gt; 'A title'\" -XPUT localhost:8080/rest/test -H'Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer</a>&gt;;rel=\"type\"' -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin}}</p>\n\n<p>{{ HTTP/1.1 415 Unsupported Media Type}}<br/>\n{{ Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 21:13:03 GMT}}<br/>\n{{ Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node010g0b7lwj5cyzr869w7hty62v0.node0; Path=/}}<br/>\n{{ Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT}}<br/>\n{{ Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 12-Nov-2020 21:13:04 GMT; SameSite=lax}}<br/>\n{{ Content-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8}}<br/>\n{{ Content-Length: 70}}<br/>\n{{ Server: Jetty(9.4.34.v20201102)}}<tt>Media type application/x-www-form-urlencoded is not a valid RDF format</tt></p>\n\n<p>{{ However tricking cUrl to not send the Content-type header does this.}}</p>\n\n<p><tt>&gt; curl -i -d \"&lt;&gt; &lt;<a href=\"http://awoods.com/#title\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://awoods.com#title</a>&gt; 'A title'\" -XPUT localhost:8080/rest/test -H'Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer</a>&gt;;rel=\"type\"' -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H\"Content-type:\"</tt></p>\n\n<p>{{ HTTP/1.1 201 Created}}<br/>\n{{ Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 21:17:28 GMT}}<br/>\n{{ Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=node0169f9d1ip9aebntkwn1r425tk1.node0; Path=/}}<br/>\n{{ Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT}}<br/>\n{{ Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Thu, 12-Nov-2020 21:17:28 GMT; SameSite=lax}}<br/>\n{{ ETag: W/\"960D4697989317E715798913D9EEEC44\"}}<br/>\n{{ X-State-Token: 960D4697989317E715798913D9EEEC44}}<br/>\n{{ Last-Modified: Fri, 13 Nov 2020 21:17:28 GMT}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test</a>&gt;; rel=\"timegate\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test</a>&gt;; rel=\"original\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test/fcr:versions</a>&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Resource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Container\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#Container</a>&gt;; rel=\"type\"}}<br/>\n{{ Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test/fcr:acl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test/fcr:acl</a>&gt;; rel=\"acl\"}}<br/>\n{{ Location: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test</a>}}<br/>\n{{ Content-Type: text/plain}}<br/>\n{{ Content-Length: 31}}<br/>\n{{ Server: Jetty(9.4.34.v20201102)}}<tt><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/test</a></tt></p>\n\n<p>{{ So I think this is fixed.}}</p>",
